{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 2026-05-06 - AI量化交易员-开源工具线索\n\n资料脑图｜按原文结构生成",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "1",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 风险提示\n- “AI自动生成策略 + 回测 + 调参”极易产生过拟合和虚假收益。\n- 视频标题提到实盘，但转写未提供风控、资金管理、合规和审计机制。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "高互动量不代表工具可靠；必须找到 GitHub 仓库、阅读代码并做独立验证。",
      "x": -79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "不构成投资建议，不建议直接接入实盘资金。",
      "x": 79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 提取状态\n- 完整转写：80-raw-原始资料/Cubox/股票/extracted/7636717976720264491_trans…\n- 视频只有约38秒，信息密度高但缺少项目名称、仓库地址和实测证据。",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "当前只能作为“AI量化工具线索”，不能当作可用策略或交易建议。",
      "x": 1071,
      "y": -46,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 视频声称\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 功能线索（来源声称）\n- 功能 / 视频说法 / 待核验\n- 自然语言生成策略 / 普通人输入策略想法，系统自动生成策略代码 / 仓库地址、代码质量、支持语言",
      "x": -720,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "回测 / 自动帮用户回测策略 / 回测框架、数据源、手续费/滑点/幸存者偏差",
      "x": -1071,
      "y": 46,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "AI调参 / 根据回测结果用大模型优化参数 / 是否过拟合、是否有样本外验证",
      "x": -1071,
      "y": -46,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    }
